 "text": "Sheriff | Sibley County, MN\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nCounty Government\nDepartments\nServices\nHow Do I...\nSearch\nHome\nDepartments\nSheriff\nSheriff\nThe Sheriff's Office provides a full range of law enforcement services to the residents of Sibley County. These services include patrolling the 588 square miles of Sibley County, investigation of crimes, incarceration of sentenced and unsentenced individuals and civil process matters. These duties are provided by over 30 highly dedicated full time and part time deputies, dispatchers, corrections officers and clerical staff members.\nThe Sheriff's Office is responsible for 17 townships, as well as providing contract police services for the cities of New Auburn and Green Isle. Sibley County also provides part time contract police services for the communities of Winthrop and Arlington.\nMission Statement\nThe mission of the Sibley County Sheriff's Office is to protect with pride and serve with dignity and respect.\nQuick Links\nMinnesota Vine System\nMinnesota Bureau of Criminal Apprehension\nMinnesota Statutes\nMinnesota Road Conditions\nMinnesota Weather Conditions\nView All Quick Links\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nContact Us\nPatrick Nienaber\nSheriff\nSheriff\nEmail the Sheriff's Office\nPhysical Address\nView Map\n419 Harrison Street\nGaylord , MN 55334\n419 Harrison Street Gaylord MN 55334\nDirections\nMailing Address\nP.O. Box 102\nGaylord , MN 55334\nPhone: 507-237-4330\nFax: 507-237-4307 (Administration)\nEmergency Phone: 911\nFax: 507-237-4334 (Jail)\nAdministration Hours\nMonday through Friday\n8 am to 4:30 pm\nJail & Dispatch Hours\n24/7\nDirectory\nSibley County Sheriff's Office Policies\nBurn Permits\nCamping Permits\nFee Table\nEmergency Management\nAvian Flu Information\nPreparing for Disaster\nGun Permits\nJail\nJail Roster\nMedication Disposal Program\nPatrol\nReport Illegal Drug Activity\nTips\nAgendas & Minutes\nEmployment\nNotify Me®\nElections & Voting\nProperty Tax\nLicenses & Permits\n-->\nContact Us\nSibley County\nGaylord, MN 55334\nPhone: 507-237-7800\nEmail Us\nQuick Links\nLicense Center\nSheriff's Office\nPublic Health and Human Services\nPublic Works\nEmployee Portal (New Intranet)\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nContact Us\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
